BLUEMIND WEB SERVICE
WEBSITE CONCEPTS — PRESENTATION AND INTERACTION REFINEMENT

Read the entire specification before making changes.

We are refining the existing portfolio/concept showcase.
We are NOT rebuilding the seven demo websites.

Work sequentially. Complete, test, and fix each phase before moving to the next phase.

Do not rush through the changes or replace working functionality with a simpler-looking but incomplete implementation.

