- Install unnecessary libraries.
- Discard unrelated or uncommitted work.

Use the current project names and IDs already implemented.

For example, if the actual projects are now called MORROW, ASTER, MERIDIAN, etc., preserve those names. Do not rename them to names from older planning messages.

