approximately 4px upward.

Transition:
approximately 220–280ms.

Add a strong, controlled blur to the cover/preview layer.

Suggested blur:
approximately 8px, adjusted if necessary.

The preview should remain recognizable as a website, but its details should become secondary.

Show the main CTA centered over the preview:

View Demo

