PHASE 5 — ENLARGE AND CLEAN UP THE WINDOW CONTROLS
==================================================

In the OPEN project viewer, make the three colored circular controls larger and easier to recognize.

Keep the familiar colors and order:

Red
Yellow
Green

Use a clean, custom BlueMind treatment rather than an exact copy of operating-system window controls.

Suggested visible circle diameter:

16–18px.

Give each circle a comfortable clickable area around it, ideally around 40–44px where space permits.

Clickable areas must not overlap.

The symbols must be centered INSIDE the circles:

Red:
Close symbol.

Yellow:
Minus/minimize symbol.

Green:
Expand/restore symbol.

